{"seq":3,"slug":"tool-comparison","title":"新一代工具横向对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/next-gen-tools/tool-comparison","wordCount":1014,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"新一代工具横向对比\">新一代工具横向对比</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>JavaScript/TypeScript 生态的代码质量工具正在经历从 JavaScript 实现向 Rust/原生实现的范式转移。这一转变不仅带来了性能的跨越式提升，还催生了&quot;格式化 + lint 统一&quot;的新架构模式。理解各工具的定位差异、能力边界和适用场景，是做出正确工具选型决策的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[代码质量工具需求] --&gt; B{选择维度}&#10;    B --&gt; C[性能优先]&#10;    B --&gt; D[生态优先]&#10;    B --&gt; E[统一优先]&#10;    C --&gt; F[oxlint + Prettier]&#10;    D --&gt; G[ESLint + Prettier]&#10;    E --&gt; H[Biome]\">flowchart TD\n    A[代码质量工具需求] --&gt; B{选择维度}\n    B --&gt; C[性能优先]\n    B --&gt; D[生态优先]\n    B --&gt; E[统一优先]\n    C --&gt; F[oxlint + Prettier]\n    D --&gt; G[ESLint + Prettier]\n    E --&gt; H[Biome]</pre><p>当前主流工具的全方位对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>ESLint</th>\n<th>Prettier</th>\n<th>Biome</th>\n<th>oxlint</th>\n<th>dprint</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语言</td>\n<td>JS</td>\n<td>JS</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式化</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>核心功能</td>\n<td>核心功能</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>核心功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lint</td>\n<td>核心功能</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>核心功能</td>\n<td>核心功能</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导入排序</td>\n<td>插件</td>\n<td>插件</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义规则</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n<td>插件</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>WASM 插件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型感知</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多语言</td>\n<td>JS/TS 为主</td>\n<td>20+ 语言</td>\n<td>JS/TS/CSS/JSON</td>\n<td>JS/TS</td>\n<td>多语言（WASM）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置格式</td>\n<td>JS/TS</td>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>JSON</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周下载量</td>\n<td>~40M</td>\n<td>~35M</td>\n<td>~3M</td>\n<td>~2M</td>\n<td>~500K</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"性能基准测试\">性能基准测试</h2><p>性能是新一代工具的核心卖点。以下数据基于典型的中大型项目（~2000 个 TypeScript 文件）的 lint 和格式化基准测试。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface BenchmarkResult {&#10;  tool: string;&#10;  lintTime: string;&#10;  formatTime: string;&#10;  totalTime: string;&#10;  memoryPeak: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const benchmarks: BenchmarkResult[] = [&#10;  { tool: &#39;ESLint&#39;, lintTime: &#39;45s&#39;, formatTime: &#39;N/A&#39;, totalTime: &#39;45s&#39;, memoryPeak: &#39;800MB&#39; },&#10;  { tool: &#39;Prettier&#39;, lintTime: &#39;N/A&#39;, formatTime: &#39;12s&#39;, totalTime: &#39;12s&#39;, memoryPeak: &#39;400MB&#39; },&#10;  { tool: &#39;ESLint + Prettier&#39;, lintTime: &#39;45s&#39;, formatTime: &#39;12s&#39;, totalTime: &#39;57s&#39;, memoryPeak: &#39;1.2GB&#39; },&#10;  { tool: &#39;Biome&#39;, lintTime: &#39;0.8s&#39;, formatTime: &#39;0.3s&#39;, totalTime: &#39;1.1s&#39;, memoryPeak: &#39;120MB&#39; },&#10;  { tool: &#39;oxlint&#39;, lintTime: &#39;0.5s&#39;, formatTime: &#39;N/A&#39;, totalTime: &#39;0.5s&#39;, memoryPeak: &#39;80MB&#39; },&#10;  { tool: &#39;oxlint + Prettier&#39;, lintTime: &#39;0.5s&#39;, formatTime: &#39;12s&#39;, totalTime: &#39;12.5s&#39;, memoryPeak: &#39;480MB&#39; },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BenchmarkResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lintTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  formatTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  memoryPeak</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> benchmarks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BenchmarkResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { tool: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ESLint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lintTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'45s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, formatTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'N/A'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, totalTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'45s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, memoryPeak: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'800MB'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { tool: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Prettier'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lintTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'N/A'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, formatTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'12s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, totalTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'12s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, memoryPeak: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'400MB'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { tool: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ESLint + Prettier'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lintTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'45s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, formatTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'12s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, totalTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'57s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, memoryPeak: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.2GB'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { tool: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Biome'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lintTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0.8s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, formatTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0.3s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, totalTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.1s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, memoryPeak: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'120MB'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { tool: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'oxlint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lintTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0.5s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, formatTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'N/A'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, totalTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0.5s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, memoryPeak: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'80MB'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { tool: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'oxlint + Prettier'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lintTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0.5s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, formatTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'12s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, totalTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'12.5s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, memoryPeak: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'480MB'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具组合</th>\n<th>Lint 耗时</th>\n<th>格式化耗时</th>\n<th>总耗时</th>\n<th>内存峰值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ESLint + Prettier</td>\n<td>45s</td>\n<td>12s</td>\n<td>57s</td>\n<td>1.2GB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Biome (lint + format)</td>\n<td>0.8s</td>\n<td>0.3s</td>\n<td>1.1s</td>\n<td>120MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>oxlint + Prettier</td>\n<td>0.5s</td>\n<td>12s</td>\n<td>12.5s</td>\n<td>480MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>oxlint + Biome format</td>\n<td>0.5s</td>\n<td>0.3s</td>\n<td>0.8s</td>\n<td>100MB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[ESLint + Prettier&lt;br/&gt;57s / 1.2GB] --&gt; B{迁移路径}&#10;    B --&gt; C[Biome 统一&lt;br/&gt;1.1s / 120MB]&#10;    B --&gt; D[oxlint + Prettier&lt;br/&gt;12.5s / 480MB]&#10;    B --&gt; E[oxlint + ESLint 混合&lt;br/&gt;15s / 600MB]\">flowchart LR\n    A[ESLint + Prettier&lt;br/&gt;57s / 1.2GB] --&gt; B{迁移路径}\n    B --&gt; C[Biome 统一&lt;br/&gt;1.1s / 120MB]\n    B --&gt; D[oxlint + Prettier&lt;br/&gt;12.5s / 480MB]\n    B --&gt; E[oxlint + ESLint 混合&lt;br/&gt;15s / 600MB]</pre><p>关键发现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Biome 的统一方案在性能和内存上都具有压倒性优势</li>\n<li>oxlint + Prettier 的组合受限于 Prettier 的性能瓶颈</li>\n<li>ESLint 的性能瓶颈主要来自 JavaScript 运行时和类型感知规则</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"功能覆盖度分析\">功能覆盖度分析</h2><p>不同工具在功能覆盖度上存在显著差异，这决定了它们适用的项目类型。</p>\n<p><strong>Lint 规则覆盖</strong>：ESLint 生态拥有最广泛的规则覆盖，包括数百个社区插件。Biome 和 oxlint 移植了最常用的规则，但尚未覆盖所有长尾需求。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则类别</th>\n<th>ESLint 生态</th>\n<th>Biome</th>\n<th>oxlint</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心语法检查</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>95%</td>\n<td>90%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript 特有</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td>70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React / Hooks</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>85%</td>\n<td>80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导入排序/验证</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>70%</td>\n<td>60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无障碍 (a11y)</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>70%</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义业务规则</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型感知规则</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>格式化覆盖</strong>：Prettier 支持最多的语言和文件格式。Biome 目前覆盖 JS/TS/CSS/JSON/GraphQL，正在扩展到更多语言。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const formatterCoverage = {&#10;  prettier: [&#10;    &#39;JavaScript&#39;,&#10;    &#39;TypeScript&#39;,&#10;    &#39;CSS&#39;,&#10;    &#39;SCSS&#39;,&#10;    &#39;Less&#39;,&#10;    &#39;HTML&#39;,&#10;    &#39;Vue&#39;,&#10;    &#39;Angular&#39;,&#10;    &#39;Svelte&#39;,&#10;    &#39;JSON&#39;,&#10;    &#39;YAML&#39;,&#10;    &#39;Markdown&#39;,&#10;    &#39;MDX&#39;,&#10;    &#39;GraphQL&#39;,&#10;    &#39;XML&#39;,&#10;    &#39;PHP&#39;,&#10;    &#39;Java&#39;,&#10;  ],&#10;  biome: [&#39;JavaScript&#39;, &#39;TypeScript&#39;, &#39;JSX&#39;, &#39;TSX&#39;, &#39;CSS&#39;, &#39;JSON&#39;, &#39;JSONC&#39;, &#39;GraphQL&#39;],&#10;  dprint: [&#39;TypeScript&#39;, &#39;JavaScript&#39;, &#39;JSON&#39;, &#39;Markdown&#39;, &#39;TOML&#39;, &#39;Dockerfile&#39;, &#39;CSS&#39;],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> formatterCoverage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prettier: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'JavaScript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'TypeScript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'CSS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'SCSS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Less'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'HTML'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Angular'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Svelte'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'JSON'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'YAML'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Markdown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;-